5,1,1,talk,Toshio,,The current ad-hoc method is failing. We need a structured approach for the year.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to verify the actual time cost before committing to any schedule.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,We must correlate usage patterns with labor distribution to ensure fairness.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,May,,I am tired of guessing the state of the rooms. Consistency is my priority.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Midori,,I worry about the friction this causes. Let’s find a system that preserves our peace.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,Toshio,,I will examine the financial records to understand our current out-of-pocket exposure.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Ryuji,,I plan to time a full cleaning pass to get objective data on duration.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,I will analyze the wall calendar and kitchen usage logs to map presence.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,May,,I need to define what 'done' actually means. I will review the previous tenants' note.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Midori,,I will look into the house chat history and the bathroom grout condition.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Without clear billing, resentment builds. I need to see the receipts.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,"If we outsource, we need to know the standard terms to compare costs.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"If someone is rarely here, they shouldn't carry the same load. I need the data.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,May,,The kitchen is unpredictable. I need to see what the previous tenants considered acceptable.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Midori,,The grout tells a story of neglect. I want to see the chat logs for context.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,Toshio,,I will look into the bathroom spray stock and the management office rate sheet.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Ryuji,,I will investigate the stopwatch timing of a full pass and the standard terms of the outside firm.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,I will investigate the absences on the wall calendar and a fortnight's watch on kitchen use.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,May,,I will investigate what each housemate counts as done and the note left by the previous tenants.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Midori,,I will investigate the rows recorded in the house chat and the bathroom grout after the July scrub.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
