35,2,1,talk,Toshio,,"The receipts show we are buying the same spray twice. The management rate is 4,200 yen an hour.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"A full pass takes two hours and twenty minutes. The firm charges 4,200 yen an hour.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Benjamin,,The calendar shows two of us away for a week or more in most months. The kitchen log shows three of us do almost all the cooking.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,The note says they split the rooms permanently and stopped speaking by year two. The definition of done is a mess.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,The chat shows the arguments start with small reminders. The grout is back to black in eleven days.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Toshio,,"If we hire the firm, the bill goes to one person. That is a liability I do not want.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"Two hours and twenty minutes is a lot. If we outsource, we still need to be present for the two-hour window.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Benjamin,,"If three of us cook, the kitchen work should fall on those three. The two who are away should not be on the kitchen rotation.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,I do not want a permanent split. I want a standard that does not depend on who is in the room.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"The grout issue is a symptom. If we do not agree on what done means, the reminders will keep coming.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Toshio,,I need a system where the cost is split evenly and no one is the collector.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"The time cost is the real issue. If we outsource, we save the two hours but pay 8,400 yen a month.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Benjamin,,The data is clear. The kitchen work should be proportional to usage. The bathroom and living room should be split by presence.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"I need a standard that is objective. If the grout is black, it is not done. If the floor is wet, it is not done.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"The chat history shows that the arguments are about the reminders, not the cleaning. We need a system that does not require reminders.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Toshio,,I am leaning toward a system that handles the billing automatically.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,I am leaning toward a system that removes the time cost entirely.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Benjamin,,I am leaning toward a system that matches the work to the usage.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"I am leaning toward a system that has a clear, objective standard.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,I am leaning toward a system that does not require anyone to be the one who brings it up.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
