62,3,1,talk,Benjamin,,Option A is the only one that matches the work to the usage. The kitchen work falls on the three who cook. The bathroom and living room fall on the three who are present.,"{""words"":34,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,1,talk,May,,"Option A has no standard. Option B has a standard, but it is the firm's standard. Option C has a standard, but it is the same for everyone.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
